WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.373 --> 00:00:16.154
cannot go back to that cave," said Guanyin.

2
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:18.475
we must go back!"

3
00:00:18.735 --> 00:00:19.516
said Wukong.

4
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:22.077
"That woman kidnapped the Tang Monk."

5
00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:24.538
Guanyin shook her head.

6
00:00:25.318 --> 00:00:26.919
woman is a scorpion spirit.

7
00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:30.892
She is very dangerous."

8
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:31.372
sure is!"

9
00:00:31.672 --> 00:00:32.553
cried Bajie.

10
00:00:32.573 --> 00:00:35.193
"What did she stab us with anyway?"

11
00:00:35.273 --> 00:00:38.974
"It was her stinger that stabbed you," said Guanyin.

12
00:00:40.135 --> 00:00:43.436
Wukong shuddered, thinking about the pain he'd felt.

13
00:00:44.496 --> 00:00:46.596
won't go near her," said Guanyin.

14
00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:48.977
"Even Buddha is afraid of her.

15
00:00:51.358 --> 00:00:55.719
He was teaching his students one day and saw that scorpion creeping toward him.

16
00:00:56.839 --> 00:00:59.160
tried to move it away, but it stung him.

17
00:01:00.384 --> 00:01:01.645
The pain was horrible!

18
00:01:03.107 --> 00:01:05.209
told his guards to capture the scorpion.

19
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.871
But it escaped to Earth."

20
00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:11.795
Wukong started pacing.

21
00:01:13.316 --> 00:01:14.777
are we going to do then?

22
00:01:15.598 --> 00:01:17.300
We must save the Tang Monk."

23
00:01:18.481 --> 00:01:22.364
"Go to Heaven and ask the Star Lord for help," said Guanyin.

24
00:01:23.165 --> 00:01:26.208
The bodhisattva then disappeared in a flash of light.

25
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.162
A little while later, Wukong stood at the southern gate of Heaven.

26
00:01:34.182 --> 00:01:37.083
"Greetings, Wukong," said the guard.

27
00:01:37.103 --> 00:01:40.824
"I must speak with the Star Lord," said the monkey.

28
00:01:41.705 --> 00:01:45.026
The guard told Wukong the way to the Star Lord's palace.

29
00:01:47.527 --> 00:01:50.688
A few minutes later, the monkey knocked on the palace door.

30
00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:55.930
said the Star Lord.

31
00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.751
"What can I do for you?"

32
00:01:57.771 --> 00:02:01.124
"I need your help," said Wukong.

33
00:02:01.144 --> 00:02:04.506
"I'm traveling to the Western Paradise with the Tang Monk.

34
00:02:05.526 --> 00:02:06.767
he was captured by a demon.

35
00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.607
Guanyin said you can help me."

36
00:02:10.728 --> 00:02:12.789
Star Lord looked confused.

37
00:02:12.809 --> 00:02:14.950
"I don't know why you need my help.

38
00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:16.911
heard you're quite strong.

39
00:02:17.711 --> 00:02:19.012
What kind of demon is it?"

40
00:02:19.092 --> 00:02:22.833
"It's a scorpion spirit," said the monkey.

41
00:02:22.853 --> 00:02:26.354
"Oh," said the Star Lord, nodding.

42
00:02:26.374 --> 00:02:27.995
"I understand now.

43
00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:29.876
Lead the way.

44
00:02:30.592 --> 00:02:31.412
We must hurry!"

45
00:02:32.773 --> 00:02:36.114
Wukong led the Star Lord out of Heaven and down to Earth.

46
00:02:38.736 --> 00:02:42.877
They landed on the mountain, where Bajie was still rubbing his nose.

47
00:02:44.018 --> 00:02:46.719
"The Star Lord is here to help us," said Wukong.

48
00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.660
Star Lord looked at Bajie's nose.

49
00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.781
"I can heal that for you."

50
00:02:52.922 --> 00:02:57.344
Bajie walked over to the Star Lord, who then blew on the pig's nose.

51
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:00.709
The injury healed instantly.

52
00:03:00.729 --> 00:03:03.989
"Thank you," said the pig, smiling.

53
00:03:04.009 --> 00:03:07.570
"I was stabbed too," said Wukong.

54
00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.091
"But the stinger didn't leave a mark on me."

55
00:03:11.091 --> 00:03:12.112
grinned at Bajie.

56
00:03:12.132 --> 00:03:15.012
"I'm much more powerful than the pig."

57
00:03:15.813 --> 00:03:16.853
Bajie frowned.

58
00:03:16.873 --> 00:03:22.494
"I have special magic that I'll use to defeat the scorpion," said the Star Lord.

59
00:03:22.514 --> 00:03:25.295
"You just need to get her to come outside."

60
00:03:27.496 --> 00:03:28.436
went up to the cave.

61
00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:35.544
Bajie and Wujing hid behind some rocks.

62
00:03:35.604 --> 00:03:41.489
Wukong stood in front of the cave entrance and shouted, "Release our master right now!"

63
00:03:42.289 --> 00:03:45.492
Then he ran as fast as he could away from the cave.

64
00:03:46.293 --> 00:03:49.215
The woman rushed out of the cave, spinning wildly.

65
00:03:51.317 --> 00:03:54.440
Suddenly the Star Lord turned into an enormous rooster.

66
00:03:55.441 --> 00:03:58.584
The rooster crowed, and the sound echoed through the mountains.

67
00:03:59.824 --> 00:04:02.465
The woman screamed and held her hands over her ears.

68
00:04:03.406 --> 00:04:07.167
The rooster crowed again, and the woman disappeared in a puff of smoke.

69
00:04:09.628 --> 00:04:11.789
In her place was a dead scorpion.

70
00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.271
ran into the cave.

71
00:04:16.191 --> 00:04:18.472
He found the Tang Monk sitting at a table.

72
00:04:20.553 --> 00:04:21.794
monk's eyes lit up.

73
00:04:21.814 --> 00:04:24.275
"Wukong! Thank you for saving me!"

74
00:04:25.335 --> 00:04:26.356
The monkey smiled.

75
00:04:27.332 --> 00:04:30.935
"As long as I'm protecting you, no demon will ever harm you."

76
00:04:32.076 --> 00:04:33.498
The Tang Monk shook his head.

77
00:04:33.518 --> 00:04:37.701
"That woman didn't want to harm me—she wanted to marry me!"

78
00:04:39.343 --> 00:04:40.404
The monk sighed.

79
00:04:40.424 --> 00:04:44.087
"But I told her that I'm a Buddhist monk and I will never marry.

80
00:04:45.288 --> 00:04:47.970
My only goal is to reach the Western Paradise."
